    {"target":"Strings/Tools","key":"Pan_Description","source":"Use to gather ore from streams.","translation":"用來從溪流中淘取礦石。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Tools","key":"Pan_Copper_Name","source":"Copper Pan","translation":"銅淘盤"},
    {"target":"Strings/Tools","key":"Pan_Steel_Name","source":"Steel Pan","translation":"鋼淘盤"},
    {"target":"Strings/Tools","key":"Pan_Steel_Description","source":"Use to gather ore from streams. Has bigger and better yields than a copper pan. It also has a small chance to immediately cause another panning spot to appear.","translation":"用來從溪流中淘取礦石。收穫量比銅淘盤更大、更好，還有小機率立即出現另一個淘礦點。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Tools","key":"Pan_Gold_Name","source":"Gold Pan","translation":"金淘盤"},
    {"target":"Strings/Tools","key":"Pan_Gold_Description","source":"Use to gather ore from streams. Has bigger and better yields than a steel pan. It also has a small chance to immediately cause another panning spot to appear.","translation":"用來從溪流中淘取礦石。收穫量比鋼淘盤更大、更好，還有小機率立即出現另一個淘礦點。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Tools","key":"Pan_Iridium_Name","source":"Iridium Pan","translation":"銥淘盤"},
    {"target":"Strings/Tools","key":"Pan_Iridium_Description","source":"Use to gather ore from streams. Has the best yields of any pan. It also has a chance to immediately cause another panning spot to appear.","translation":"用來從溪流中淘取礦石。收穫量勝過所有其他淘盤，還有機率立即出現另一個淘礦點。"},
